{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_whitw2_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_whitw2_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"气味游戏","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_whitw2_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7bc54a1b78e15735fce2e8304d8db071bead04cc3d9a54f8eb59f5f5bc6d5748","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古，你也来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的嗅觉应该比你差吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，看来我们找对了地方——那东西就在这间病房内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼群搜遍这艘陆行舰的每一个角落，只为了找拉普兰德不知什么时候弄丢在哪儿的信物......你不觉得滑稽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别抱怨了，恺撒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头狼有资格驱使狼群做任何事情，这是我们共同的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧结束这一切吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，你的獠牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻微的鼾声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的呓语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德的气味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红紧握的那把匕首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德丢失的信物，怎么会是你獠牙的匕首？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哪怕成为了头狼，白狼终究只是个幼稚的人类。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，扎罗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那阵烟尘，只是野生驮兽为了躲避罗德岛闹出的动静，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野就在眼前，何必问我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耐心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不像是你会说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一艘偶然偏航的陆行舰短暂闯入荒野的深处，和那些漫游的神秘存在擦肩而过，我们因为恰好在甲板上，得以和其中的个体打个招呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道为了帮你们和你们的同类安排这么一场别开生面的会晤，我费了多大劲，干嘛要急在一时？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你原本没有必要折腾这一出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以直接去到龙门，或者阿卡胡拉，那几个家伙的行踪更好掌握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，扎罗，狼群确实越来越像人类了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然可以约德克萨斯的老板去听地下说唱，或者和那个叫鸭爵的家伙相会在赌桌上，还在叙拉古时，我没少做这样的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们这样的在兽主里只是少数，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果所谓的“危机”真的那么可怕，你的第一反应竟然是找到同样泡在人类社会里的同类，然后像人类那样凑在一起开会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫其他狼回来吧，再过不久，你们的那些同类就会经过这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恺撒还在帮你找信物......等等，你没有弄丢信物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"压根没有所谓的信物，扎罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你故意让恺撒见到那个被她抛弃的獠牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我可没说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外婆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"红看见了，外婆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是靠近，她仍在睡梦中都会情不自禁地颤抖......这个孩子对你的恐惧已经深入骨髓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停止你无聊的恶趣味，恺撒。我们拿了匕首走就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把匕首，是我送给红的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个孩子刚懂事时，我找来一支兽牙，教她将其打磨成最锋利的匕首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不明白？拉普兰德故意支使我来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她希望我拿回这把匕首？不，她希望我抹除这个人类的恐惧和痛苦，她希望我消弭我之于这个人类的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这不像拉普兰德的作派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮一帮可怜的同事，或者向自己正挂靠的医药公司示好......她的心思不难猜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我说，哪怕成为了头狼，她终究只是个幼稚的人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里等着，瓦古，我很快就结束这无聊的“任务”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆......真的是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了外婆，还能是谁呢......真是个可怜的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，打我登上这艘船，这是你第五次跟踪我了，红干员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红闻到了熟悉的味道，从你身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你说的是狼味，我身上可不止一种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆她来了这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你是外婆找来取代红的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来，你想杀了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果博士和你那个爱藏在烟雾里的上司不追究，我倒是很乐意活动活动筋骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"不......红不要和你战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不知道怎么解释......外婆找上你，你会像红一样，到最后，被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，感谢你的关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在发抖，红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆对红说，说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红和被红杀死的那些家伙一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是为她赢得了一场索然无味的胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红听了外婆的话，红没有听凯尔希的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红做了一件错事，一件又一件错事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红既是猎狼人，也是真狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红的心，很乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的呜咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红，你恨那只狼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要忘记她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，这里是罗德岛，你的罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我非常愿意帮你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这样。凯尔希不在岛上，你说我怎么能置之不理呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，你希望我夸你热心，还是夸你善良？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎罗，你希望我认为你谄媚，还是认为你阴阳怪气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，这次你要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆没有要离开，外婆在等你跟上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红色的幼狼无意识地抬了抬脚，但她很快反应了过来，最终没有动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怀疑，孩子，你觉得外婆还有欺瞒你的必要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的疑惑，你的痛苦，外婆都会给你回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来，来外婆身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"熟悉的声音，温柔的语调，微风吹过草地，刮起泥土里隐隐的腥味......很安全。\n仿佛一切从来没有改变。\n良久。\n幼狼终于还是情不自禁地迈开了步子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这是梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是梦，也是真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上就好，红。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不说话？以前每次分别后重逢，你都会缠着外婆问东问西......尽管连话都说不利索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你心里有恨，你责怪外婆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......外婆欺骗了红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红信任外婆，外婆不该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若说“不该”，孩子，你我之间不该有这些无聊的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，你也欺骗了外婆，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢节的那个夜晚，你没有真正杀死阿涅塞的獠牙，那个幼崽叫什么名字来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"子、子月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你留了手，你想要试探外婆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼主确实会折断獠牙，但母兽不会遗弃她的孩子，尽管谎言是她给的襁褓，但荒野中生命的关系总会因纯粹而牢靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可罗德岛上的人也好，那个裁缝也好......他们并不理解荒野，你却轻易听信了那些说辞，你让我们的关系有了裂痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相已经不重要，游戏的输赢已经不重要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今这一切，是外婆应受的屈辱，也是你应受的惩罚，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红记得这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆说过，这是梦，也是真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这簇草丛......外婆教红隐藏气味，安静等待猎物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这棵树......外婆教红制作陷阱，把它藏在枯叶下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"那边，那块石头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾在上面打磨兽牙，直到它变成锋利的匕首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们刚刚路过的每一片树林，每一个山洞，每一具骨骸......都是你的来路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆在带红往回走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会在哪里停下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在想刚刚的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红必须想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红的心很乱，红想不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，虽然漫长的岁月里，狼主间的游戏已经更迭了无数轮，但你仍是我最为特别的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有你，真正在以狼的方式生存，以狼的方式思考，尽管留在了这艘陆行舰上，也永远无法真正融入人群......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太纯粹，你无限接近于，真正的狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的狼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，孩子，忘记外婆刚刚说的话吧，忘记我们彼此间的仇恨与责怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这些情感对你来说太过复杂......因为这并不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们终于到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你我相遇的地方，外婆在那边的草窠里捡到了被遗弃的红。那天晚上暴雨如注，你的哭声差一点消散在雨里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是此行的终点，也是一切的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆会烧掉那个草窠，然后，我们刚刚途经的一切便将不复存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红会忘记外婆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红会忘记和外婆有关的所有事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将忘记我带来的困惑、痛苦和哀伤，仿佛我从未存在过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......红不会再做噩梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，真是个聪明的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。\n红色的幼狼低着头，紧攥着的手骨节发白，她没有再说话，看起来极为痛苦。\n优雅的狼主没有紧逼，她决定给幼崽一点时间，尽管......自己的耐心早已所剩无几。\n终于，幼狼抬起了头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，红不愿意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红，你恨那只狼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要忘记她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，这里是罗德岛，你的罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我非常愿意帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就说明你不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不想？没有人教红该怎么处理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的直觉很准，红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛和欺骗编织了你的人生，痛苦让人想要遗忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但忘记是没有用的，那等于抽了筋扒了骨，将自己变成一具空壳......那是更残忍的暴力，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你熟悉荒野，噩梦同样能帮助你活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我突然有个主意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不需要忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆告诫过红，红记得外婆的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"必须牢记仇恨，盯紧仇人，红才不会迷路，才挥得动刀......红才能够活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红以前为外婆报仇......报不存在的仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红现在为自己报仇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红跟腱发力，高高跃起，那是狼的狩猎技巧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"极短的一瞬，红已经一刀将狼主劈成了两半。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"神秘的黑雾散开，淋漓的鲜血冲刷着红的身体，让她看起来仿佛鬼魅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红的手剧烈地颤抖，仿佛不敢相信自己刚刚做了什么......她晕了过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可下一个瞬间，黑雾再次聚拢，狼主重新来到红的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦境给了你冒犯我的底气？可这一切毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然不愿意遗忘，那就带着关于我的一切活着吧，让噩梦叠加噩梦，让痛苦缠绕痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，也好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旧的游戏已经结束，可我对拉普兰德能为我们带来多少新乐趣，并不像扎罗他们那样有信心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就留你作为一个时代的烙印存在吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但估计下一个转眼，我就会将你彻底遗忘，幼崽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，你和那些被我折断的獠牙，其实没有任何区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古，出来吧，我们该走了，这里的气味可真难闻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......这个气味，不对不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，是你搞的鬼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古，我刚刚没有听错吧，恺撒是不是质疑了头狼来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我身上，怎么会有红的气味？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？竟然有这样的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想，刚刚到底发生了什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红用刀划伤了你，你的血淋在了红身上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，难道说，你和你的獠牙交换了气味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是我赐予她的梦境！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灼烧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好大的雨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指望这些方式能够消除身上的异味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有用的，我亲爱的狼之主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞告诉我，遥远的岁月前，这片大地唯有荒蛮，狼群各自出没，你们会通过交换气味来识别、交流和标记领地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们以此合作狩猎，也以此猎杀彼此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到生命终结，你们都无法抹除身上沾染的其他狼的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红的匕首......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把匕首确实是我的信物......它受到了“头狼的赐福”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞，是你教拉普兰德......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿涅塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她不止问了我，我并不知道她要做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，我忘记了一件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主不死不灭，狼之主永恒存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恺撒，看来。未来你只能带着红的气味行走在这片大地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管你从未正视过这个獠牙，尽管你早已将她抛弃，但这份气味会始终提醒你她的存在，让你永远无法将她遗忘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为不死不灭，所以永无尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（凄厉的呼号）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你也可以随时报复我，这会为我的新游戏提供一些灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要做这一切？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身为头狼，你居然只是为了幼稚的同僚之情，而如此算计、羞辱自己的狼群？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说我只是因为同情红？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，幼稚的狼之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恺撒，我可不单单只是为了红而羞辱你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎罗、瓦古、阿涅塞，还有那边的几只......我希望这件事能让你们警醒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼群正变得越来越像人类。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狼之主们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原野苍茫，蛮荒无序，我并不在意你们对人类或是同类有多残忍......这本就是荒野的常态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是恺撒，你连对獠牙残忍的方式都像极了人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欺骗、背叛、粉饰，扭曲认知，种下噩梦......你在耍弄最粗浅的权力，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（无奈的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们告诉我，那场所谓的“危机”已经近在咫尺，狼群需要接触众多同类......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从萨米的雪原到玻利瓦尔的黑流树海，从萨尔贡的黄沙到伊比利亚的盐漠......习惯和人类厮混的兽主只是少数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我当然要向他们证明，新的狼群，将会更纯粹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，拉普兰德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们快到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开这个梦境吧，让这个叫红的孩子睡个好觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回甲板......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼群，该去赴荒野的约了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]}]}
